---
/* Built for Your Stack — Tech Credibility */
---

<section class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-core-surface relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-ember mb-4">
            Built for your stack
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl text-core-text-primary leading-[1.15] max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-6">
            Whatever you're building, Blisp <span class="text-brand-ember">gets it.</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-core-text-secondary text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16 leading-relaxed">
            Whether you're spinning up a monolithic NestJS backend or debugging a tricky React frontend, Blisp understands your context and finds the right resources.
        </p>

        <!-- Tech Logo Marquee -->
        <div class="relative">
            <div class="absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-24 bg-gradient-to-r from-core-surface to-transparent z-10 pointer-events-none"></div>
            <div class="absolute right-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-24 bg-gradient-to-l from-core-surface to-transparent z-10 pointer-events-none"></div>

            <!-- Row 1 -->
            <div class="flex gap-6 mb-6 overflow-hidden marquee-container">
                <div class="flex gap-6 animate-marquee">
                    <div class="flex-shrink-0 px-8 py-4 rounded-2xl bg-core-background border border-semantic-border/30 flex items-center gap-3">
                        <img src="" alt="React" class="w-7 h-7" />
                        <span class="text-sm font-medium text-core-text-primary">React</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex-shrink-0 px-8 py-4 rounded-2xl bg-core-background border border-semantic-border/30 flex items-center gap-3">
                        <img src="" alt="Node.js" class="w-7 h-7" />
                        <span class="text-sm font-medium text-core-text-primary">Node.js</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex-shrink-0 px-8 py-4 rounded-2xl bg-core-background border border-semantic-border/30 flex items-center gap-3">
